      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, you moved the call of generic_set_encrypted_ci_d_ops() into __fscrypt_prepare_lookup().  That\u0027s wrong, because __fscrypt_prepare_lookup() (note the two underscores) is only called if the directory is encrypted.  But directories can be casefolded without being encrypted, and generic_set_encrypted_ci_d_ops() has to be called for those too.\n\nSo we need to keep the calls to set the dentry ops in each filesystem (ext4, f2fs, and ubifs), like in current android12-5.4.",
